{{#if this.locale.isKorean}}
  <article class="sky-floor-page page ac-page full-bleed" {{aqua-reveal}}>
    <section class="ac-hero ac-hero--photo">
      <div class="ac-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/sky-floor-hero-green.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="ac-inner ac-hero__grid ac-hero__grid--solo">
        <div class="ac-hero__content">
          <h1 class="ac-hero__titleimg">
            <img src="/images/sky-floor-hero-title.png" alt="" />
            <span class="ac-sr-only">SKY FLOOR — We Create Value</span>
          </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-hero__certs" aria-hidden="true"><img
            src="/images/cert-kcl.png"
            alt=""
          /><img src="/images/cert-eco.png" alt="" /><img
            src="/images/cert-sps.png"
            alt=""
          /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-metrics">
        <div class="ac-inner ac-metrics__grid">
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">메쉬</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >스테인리스 메쉬 보강</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">Low VOC</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >친환경 무자극</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">내진</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >내진 성능</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">열충격</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >열충격 저항성</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="margin-page">
      <section class="ac-sec ac-concept" id="about">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Overview</span>
          <h2>Sky Floor 소개</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-cardgrid ac-cardgrid--3">
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <h3>물질형태</h3>
            <p>Sky Floor 바닥재는 내향균성 성능을 발현하는 바닥재 전용 수지에
              소성 가공한 무기 재료로 구성된 파우더를 첨가 혼합하여 고밀도
              비흡수성 불침투성 미끄럼방지 성능의 바닥재를 형성합니다. 또한
              저휘발성유기화합물(Low VOC) 함량의 친환경 제품입니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <h3>구조형태</h3>
            <p>Sky Floor 바닥재는 Stainless Wire Glass Mesh Sheet와 Sky
              Resin과의 강력한 결합구조로 콘크리트 구조체에서 발생하는 균열에
              대한 저항성능으로 바닥재를 보호하며 바닥재의 탈락 현상을 방지하는
              효과를 통하여 바닥재로서의 장기적인 내구성을 발현하는 바닥재
              솔루션입니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <h3>마감형태</h3>
            <p>Sky Floor 바닥재는 현장요구조건 및 현장상황에 따라서 제품의
              사양을 달리 적용하여 시공두께 및 표면 마감상태를 다양하게 표현이
              가능합니다. 이음매가 없는 단색마감, 미끄럼방지성능을 발현하는
              마감, 인테리어 미관 성능을 발현하는 표면 형태로 마감이 가능합니다.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-structure" id="structure">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Structure</span>
          <h2>Sky Floor 구조도</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-skystruct ac-reveal" data-d="1">
          <div class="ac-skystruct__item">
            <h3>컬러 쿼츠 (Color Quartz)</h3>
            <div class="ac-skystruct__pair">
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-quartz-diagram.jpg"
                  alt="Sky Floor 컬러 쿼츠 레이어 구조도"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-quartz-colors.jpg"
                  alt="컬러 쿼츠 색상 차트"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ac-skystruct__item">
            <h3>컬러 플레이크 (Color Flakes)</h3>
            <div class="ac-skystruct__pair">
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-flakes-diagram.jpg"
                  alt="Sky Floor 컬러 플레이크 레이어 구조도"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-flakes-colors.jpg"
                  alt="컬러 플레이크 색상 차트"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-features" id="properties">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Properties</span>
          <h2>Sky Floor 특징</h2>
          <p>Sky Floor의 물리적·화학적·위생 성능을 한눈에 확인해 보세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-fgrid">
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.5-7-9V6z" /><path
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>균열 저항성</h3>
            <p>Stainless Wire Glass Mesh Sheet와 Sky Resin의 강력한 결합력으로
              구조체에서 발생하는 균열로부터 바닥재를 보호합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M4 21h16" /><path d="M6 21V6l6-3 6 3v15" /><path
                  d="M9.5 21v-4h5v4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>내진 성능</h3>
            <p>강력한 결합구조(Sheet+Resin)로 바닥 균열 및 건물 움직임에
              대응하여 박리·탈락을 방지하고 장기 내구성을 발현합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                  d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11z"
                /><path d="M5 4l14 16" /></svg></div>
            <h3>비흡수 성능</h3>
            <p>치밀한 구조로 형성되어 세제나 화학물질의 침투를 차단합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="4">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.5-7-9V6z" /><path
                  d="M12.5 8l-2 4h3l-2 4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>내충격성</h3>
            <p>고강도 바닥재로서 우수한 압축강도를 발현합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                  d="M10 13.5V5a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v8.5a4 4 0 1 1-4 0z"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>열충격 저항성</h3>
            <p>시공 두께와 사양에 따라 고온 살균과 저온 환경의 급격한 온도
              변화에도 견딥니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                  d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10z"
                /><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6" /></svg></div>
            <h3>친환경 제품</h3>
            <p>저휘발성 유기화합물(Low VOC)을 함유한 친환경 제품입니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M9 3h6" /><path
                  d="M10 3v6l-4.5 8A2 2 0 0 0 7.3 20h9.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.8-3L14 9V3"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>내화학성</h3>
            <p>산·알칼리·용제 등 산업용 세정제에도 저항성능을 발현합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="4">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" /><path
                  d="M12 8.5V5M12 19v-3.5M8.5 12H5M19 12h-3.5M9.4 9.4L7 7M17 17l-2.4-2.4M14.6 9.4L17 7M7 17l2.4-2.4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>내항균성</h3>
            <p>제품 시공 후 바닥 표면으로부터 곰팡이세균 및 미생물 번식을
              차단합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path
                  d="M8 12l2.5 2.5L16 9"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>인체무해성</h3>
            <p>벤젠·톨루엔·자일렌 등 인체 유해 화합물 발생이 없습니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M3 8h11a3 3 0 1 0-3-3" /><path
                  d="M3 12h15a3 3 0 1 1-3 3"
                /><path d="M3 16h9" /></svg></div>
            <h3>비취오염성</h3>
            <p>신너 등 희석제를 사용하지 않아 자극적인 냄새가 없으며 HACCP 식품
              사업장의 냄새·맛을 오염시키지 않습니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                  d="M12 3l1.6 4.4L18 9l-4.4 1.6L12 15l-1.6-4.4L6 9l4.4-1.6z"
                /><path
                  d="M18.5 14l.7 2 2 .7-2 .7-.7 2-.7-2-2-.7 2-.7z"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>청결 &amp; 안전성</h3>
            <p>시공 후 청소·유지관리가 용이하며 안전한 작업 환경을 제공합니다.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="4">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M4 9c2-2 4-2 6 0s4 2 6 0 4-2 4-2" /><path
                  d="M4 15c2-2 4-2 6 0s4 2 6 0 4-2 4-2"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>미끄럼방지</h3>
            <p>최적의 미끄럼방지 성능을 구현합니다.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-gallery" id="gallery">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Gallery</span>
          <h2>Gallery</h2>
          <p>컬러 쿼츠/플레이크/단색, 아쿠아크리트 보강, 코빙, 트렌치 보강까지
            다양한 마감 사례를 확인하세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-gallery__panel ac-reveal" data-d="1">
          <AcGalleryTabs
            @isKorean={{this.locale.isKorean}}
            @categories={{this.skyGalleryCategories}}
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-callout" id="callout">
        <div class="ac-callout__box ac-reveal">
          <div>
            <h2>Mesh Reinforced · Hygienic · Durable</h2>
            <p>크린텍 Sky Floor 팀이 현장 맞춤 진단, 시공, 유지관리 교육까지
              원스톱으로 제공합니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ac-callout__cta">
            <LinkTo @route="contact" class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary">현장 컨설팅
              신청
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
            </LinkTo>
            <LinkTo @route="downloads" class="ac-btn ac-btn--ghost">브로슈어 /
              SDS 보기</LinkTo>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
{{else}}
  <article class="sky-floor-page page ac-page full-bleed" {{aqua-reveal}}>
    <section class="ac-hero ac-hero--photo">
      <div class="ac-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/sky-floor-hero-green.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="ac-inner ac-hero__grid ac-hero__grid--solo">
        <div class="ac-hero__content">
          <h1 class="ac-hero__titleimg">
            <img src="/images/sky-floor-hero-title.png" alt="" />
            <span class="ac-sr-only">SKY FLOOR — We Create Value</span>
          </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-hero__certs" aria-hidden="true"><img
            src="/images/cert-kcl.png"
            alt=""
          /><img src="/images/cert-eco.png" alt="" /><img
            src="/images/cert-sps.png"
            alt=""
          /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ac-metrics">
        <div class="ac-inner ac-metrics__grid">
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">Mesh</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >Stainless mesh reinforced</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">Low VOC</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >Eco &amp; non-irritant</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">Seismic</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >Seismic performance</div></div>
          <div class="ac-metric"><div class="ac-metric__n">Thermal</div><div
              class="ac-metric__l"
            >Thermal-shock resistant</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="margin-page">
      <section class="ac-sec ac-concept" id="about">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Overview</span>
          <h2>About Sky Floor</h2>
          <p>Sky Floor is a long-life hygienic floor system that blends eco
            polyols, ceramic fillers, and stainless mesh.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-cardgrid ac-cardgrid--3">
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <h3>Material Form</h3>
            <p>Plant-based polyol polyurethane resin mixes with kiln-fired
              inorganic powder to achieve a dense, non-absorptive, impermeable,
              slip-resistant surface. The formulation remains Low VOC to protect
              people and product.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <h3>Structural Form</h3>
            <p>A Stainless Wire Glass Mesh Sheet interlocks with Sky Resin to
              block crack transmission from concrete and prevent debonding,
              delivering long-term durability.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-infocard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <h3>Finish Form</h3>
            <p>Thickness and surface texture are tailored to each site, ranging
              from seamless solid colors to aggressive anti-slip and
              design-forward finishes.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-structure" id="structure">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Structure</span>
          <h2>Sky Floor Structure</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-skystruct ac-reveal" data-d="1">
          <div class="ac-skystruct__item">
            <h3>Color Quartz</h3>
            <div class="ac-skystruct__pair">
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-quartz-diagram.jpg"
                  alt="Sky Floor Color Quartz layer structure"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-quartz-colors.jpg"
                  alt="Color Quartz color chart"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ac-skystruct__item">
            <h3>Color Flakes</h3>
            <div class="ac-skystruct__pair">
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-flakes-diagram.jpg"
                  alt="Sky Floor Color Flakes layer structure"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
              <figure><img
                  src="/images/sky-struct-flakes-colors.jpg"
                  alt="Color Flakes color chart"
                  loading="lazy"
                /></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ac-sec ac-features" id="properties">
        <div class="ac-head ac-reveal">
          <span class="ac-eyebrow">Properties</span>
          <h2>Key Properties</h2>
          <p>Physical, chemical, and hygienic performance at a glance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ac-fgrid">
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.5-7-9V6z" /><path
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>Crack Resistance</h3>
            <p>The Stainless Mesh and Sky Resin composite shields the topping
              from substrate cracking.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="2">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M4 21h16" /><path d="M6 21V6l6-3 6 3v15" /><path
                  d="M9.5 21v-4h5v4"
                /></svg></div>
            <h3>Seismic Performance</h3>
            <p>The sheet-plus-resin build flexes with building movement and
              temperature swings.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ac-fcard ac-reveal" data-d="3">
            <div class="ac-fcard__ic"><svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
